  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Tech Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to have a platform where persons with disabilities will grow in tech while learning, collaborating and innovating their local and affordable Digital Assistive Technologies that meet their needs. The idea came after reviewing the activities of our past trainings on ICT and coding for persons with disabilities, and also after consulting our beneficiaries. The center will start training 30 youth with disabilities (Blind an Deaf) on basic digital skills and on advanced skills.</narrative>
  </description>
